&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a motivated self-starter with a bias toward action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embrace a user-centric design sensibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take complex challenges and break them down to achieve short feedback loops: to analyze, design, and build modular solutions, deliver MVPs, gather data and feedback and then progress iteratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You invest in your colleagues and generously share your experience and knowledge, while also learning from your peers and growing your own skillset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to communicate and collaborate effectively in a remote first environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
